cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Soilwork, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Soilwork: a reading companion to fundamental laws of soil, environmental and agricultural science"
abstract: >-
  Interactive single-page reading companion with 103 entries on fundamental laws
  and processes in physics, chemistry, soil science, environmental science,
  research methods and agricultural economics, a concept map, 14 reading paths,
  briefs, and a 216-question quiz built around common misconceptions with
  feedback that links back to the section to reread.
authors:
